The  driver  supports the following adapters: The driver provides
support for USB adapters based on the Kawasaki  LSI  KL5KLUSB101B
chipset.  The KL5KLUSB101B supports a 128‐entry multicast filter,
single perfect filter entry for the station address and promiscu‐
ous mode.  Packets are received and transmitted over separate USB
bulk  transfer  endpoints.   The  Kawasaki  adapter supports only
10Mbps half‐duplex mode, hence there are no modes to select.  For
more information on configuring this device, see See for diagnos‐
tics.  The device driver first appeared in and in The driver  was
written  by  The driver does not accumulate collisions statistics
because the Kawasaki firmware does not appear to maintain any in‐
ternal statistics.
